{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s02e06-scene-11",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "善悪の知識の実  (The Fruit of Knowledge of Good and Evil)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "furuya": "古谷",
    "muranishi": "村西",
    "takei": "武井"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back in Furuya's office, Detective Takei and Furuya compare notes on their trap—revealing Furuya handed Muranishi not only 250 million yen, but also an uncensored master tape that Muranishi couldn't resist selling.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "胴体半分で生きてやがる、まるで蛇だな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "生命力だけが取り柄でな。ここいらにはまだ食える実がいくらでもある。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "そのうちお前も追放してやるからな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "蛇はあんただろ。知恵入れてそそのかしやがって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "来たか？村西。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "ああ、あんたのプレゼント受け取ったよ。二億五千万つけてやった。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "それで？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "食ったさ。善悪の知識の実をな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "そうなると思ったよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "順調だな、あんたの計画も。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "いやいや、まだまだ途中だよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ようやくめどが立ちそうだよ。久々に事務所で軽く一杯やるか。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "胴体半分で生きてやがる、まるで蛇だな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still alive with half a working body—you're just like a snake.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "生命力だけが取り柄でな。ここいらにはまだ食える実がいくらでもある。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Vitality is my one strong suit. Around here there is still plenty of ripe fruit left to eat.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "そのうちお前も追放してやるからな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Before long I'll banish you from this garden too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "蛇はあんただろ。知恵入れてそそのかしやがって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You're the real snake—whispering clever ideas to tempt him.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "来たか？村西。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did Muranishi come to you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "ああ、あんたのプレゼント受け取ったよ。二億五千万つけてやった。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yeah, I accepted the present you sent my way and attached 250 million yen to it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "それで？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And then?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "食ったさ。善悪の知識の実をな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He ate it right up—the fruit of knowledge of good and evil.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "そうなると思ったよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I knew it would turn out that way.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "順調だな、あんたの計画も。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your little plan is coming along smoothly too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "いやいや、まだまだ途中だよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, no—we're still only halfway through.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ようやくめどが立ちそうだよ。久々に事務所で軽く一杯やるか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Things are finally looking up. Let's have a celebratory drink at the office for the first time in ages.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
